## Selection Protocol (follow EXACTLY in order)

{% if candidates %}
STEP 1 — EXACT MATCH CHECK:
List ALL candidates whose preferred_term is an exact or near-exact match for "{{ entity_text }}" (case-insensitive). Write them out explicitly.
If you find exact matches, select the one with the highest score. An exact match ALWAYS wins. Stop here.

STEP 2 — QUALIFIER MISMATCH REJECTION:
If "{{ entity_text }}" contains NO qualifier (no age, stage, site, subtype, laterality), REJECT any candidate that ADDS a qualifier not in the entity text.
Examples of rejection:
- Entity "Ankylosing Spondylitis" REJECTS "Juvenile ankylosing spondylitis"
- Entity "Diabetes" REJECTS "Type 1 Diabetes"
- Entity "Serum creatinine" REJECTS "Serum creatinine raised"

STEP 3 — SEMANTIC SELECTION:
Only if Steps 1-2 produce no winner, evaluate remaining candidates by clinical meaning match.

State:
